        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>显著了吗</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>→</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>闸 2</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>护栏守住了吗</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>→</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>闸 3</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>成本与可逆性算过吗</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>没有实验条件时：三个替代法（各有一个弱点）</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 16, flex: 1.2 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>前后对照</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>弱点：分不清改动效果与自然趋势、季节波动</Text>
